"---
title: "SDK Release sdk-2026-07-30"
date: "2026-07-30"
---

This release improves SDK release preparation.

### SDK Versions

| SDK | Released version |
| --- | --- |
| Python \`composio\` | \`0.18.1\` |
| TypeScript \`@composio/core\` | \`0.14.1\` |

### Improvements

- Release preparation is now deterministic.

### Bug Fixes

- Connected account refresh failures are fixed.
"
